            "Assign start-column bands cyclically across a team capped at four workers.",
            "Reuse a private reserved frequency table and 64-bit subtotal per worker; combine results through OpenMP reduction or after thread joins.",
            "Keep workloads below 131072 estimated row visits serial to avoid thread-launch overhead."
          ]
