          "retained": [
            "Retain reusable 8-byte linear-probing slots at no more than 50% occupancy, touched-slot clearing, zero-prefix initialization and query-before-increment ordering.",
            "Pair over min(m,n) and build an oriented, boundary-major summed-area table contiguous along max(m,n).",
            "Generate complete band-prefix keys using a worker-private buffer and an independent GCC ivdep subtraction loop.",
            "Retain cyclic assignment across at most four workers, private 64-bit subtotals and the 131072-row-visit serial cutoff, recomputed for the oriented dimensions."
          ]
